    "title": "Al Quran MP3 - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645",
    "description": "Read & Listen Quran e Kareem (\u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645) with Translation in All Languages!\r\n\r\nEnhance your spiritual journey with Al Quran MP3, the comprehensive app that brings you the Holy Quran in its entirety, along with a wealth of features to deepen your understanding and connection.\r\n\r\nAl Quran MP3 (\u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645)  Features:\r\n\r\n1. Quran with Translation: Read the Holy Quran with translations in popular languages including Bengali, Chinese, French, German, Hindi, Indonesian, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Persian, Portuguese, Russian, Spanish, Swedish, Turkish, Urdu, and Dutch. Experience the beauty of the Quran in your native language.\r\n\r\nAlso enjoy16-Line Quran PDF: Immerse yourself in the sacred text of the Quran with our high-quality 16-line PDF format. Enjoy a reading experience that closely resembles a physical Quran.\r\n\r\n2. Verse by Verse Tafseer: Gain a deeper understanding with detailed Tafseer for each verse while reading. Discover the context and meaning behind every ayah.\r\n\r\n\r\n3. Transliteration: Easily follow along with the Arabic text using transliterations provided for each verse. Perfect for non-Arabic speakers to improve their pronunciation.\r\n\r\n\r\n4. Verse by Verse Audio Recitation: Listen to the Quran being recited verse by verse. Perfect for memorization and reflection, bringing the words of Allah closer to your heart.\r\n\r\n5. Full Quran Kareem MP3 Player Offline: Enjoy uninterrupted listening with our full Quran MP3 player, available offline. Listen to any surah at any time, without the need for an internet connection.\r\n\r\n6. Qibla Direction: Easily find the direction of Qibla for your prayers, no matter where you are. Never miss your prayer direction with our precise Qibla compass.\r\n\r\n7. Prayer Times: Stay on top of your prayer schedule with accurate Salah timings based on your location. Get notifications for each prayer time to ensure you never miss a prayer.\r\n\r\n8. Calendar: Access both Hijri and Gregorian calendars within the app. Keep track of important Islamic dates and events with ease.\r\n\r\n9. Daily Inspirations: Receive daily reminders to keep your faith strong and your spirit uplifted:\r\n\u2022\tDua of the Day\r\n\u2022\tHadith of the Day\r\n\u2022\tVerse of the Day\r\n\u2022\tSurah of the Day\r\n\r\n10. AI Mufti: Access instant answers to your Islamic queries through our AI-powered Mufti. Ask questions about various aspects of Islamic knowledge and receive prompt and informative responses.\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Al Quran MP3 - Al Quran MP3 - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645?\r\n\u2022\tUser-Friendly Interface: Designed for ease of use, our app is perfect for all ages.\r\n\u2022\tOffline Access: Enjoy all features without any interruptions, even without an internet connection.\r\n\u2022\tComprehensive Islamic Resource: A one-stop app for all your Islamic needs, from prayer times to daily inspirations.\r\n\r\nDownload Al Quran MP3   \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 today and bring the divine words of Allah into your daily life. Embark on a journey of faith, knowledge, and spirituality with our all-in-one Quran app.",
